Sound: PC speaker effects from the IWAD's DP* lumps.
 - new efi/i_pcspeaker.c: 1/140 s pitch sequences into 8254 channel 2,
   gated by port 0x61; divisor table from DMX (via Chocolate Doom); one
   voice with Doom priorities; serviced from the frame loop and the
   tic wait loop; silenced on every exit path
 - used when no AudioIo (AudioDxe) output exists; -pcspeaker forces it,
   -nopcspeaker / -nosfx disable it

